{
  "comment": "GET /api/v1/rules and GET /api/v1/dns/rules as the r4 engine reports them for a live configuration, with the source bytes the router served in GET /api/v1/config. The expression is the source text as written, the source names the relative file and its 1-based line, and a must rule reports the outbound without the `must` parameter and `must: true`. Device addresses and MACs are replaced by documentation-range placeholders of the same length, so no line, column or byte offset moves; the rule lines, their spellings and their positions are otherwise the configuration the engine read.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "id": "src_845522dfc34ebacd",
      "path": "config.d/routing.dae",
      "kind": "include",
      "content": "routing {\n# ① 本机进程直连（上游原意：避免绑定 WAN 时连通性检查出现假阴性）：本机实际只有 dnsmasq，NetworkManager / systemd-resolved 为模板保留项\n#pname(NetworkManager, systemd-resolved, dnsmasq) -> must_direct\n\n# ② Cloudflare DoH 上游走代理：对应 DNS 配置里的 https://1.1.1.1/dns-query，固定经代理以保证可用（不依赖该地址直连质量）\ndip(1.1.1.1, 1.0.0.1) && l4proto(tcp) && dport(443) -> proxy(must)\n\n# ③ 组播/保留网段直连：224.0.0.0/3（含 IPv4 组播 224/4 与 240/4 保留段）、ff00::/8（IPv6 组播）——必须排在 ④ 之前，否则 IPv6 组播会被一并阻断\ndip(224.0.0.0/3, 'ff00::/8') -> direct\n\n# ④ 阻断全部 IPv6：避免 v6 绕过分流（br-lan 未下发 v6 前缀、代理节点无 v6 出口；WAN 侧虽有原生 v6 但仅路由器自身可用）\nipversion(6) -> block\n\n# ⑤ 指定设备直连（must_direct，永久绕过代理）：203.0.113.4 box（UU 加速盒，MAC 00:00:00:00:00:00）、203.0.113.10 NAS（MAC 00:00:00:00:00:01）——MAC 与 IP 双写\nmac('00:00:00:00:00:00') -> must_direct\nmac('00:00:00:00:00:01') -> must_direct\ndip(203.0.113.4) -> must_direct\ndip(203.0.113.10) -> must_direct\n\n# ⑥ 广告拦截：只保留 geosite:category-ads（843 条精选域，官方文档同款写法）——已移除 category-ads-all（19 万条自动生成列表含大量 App 遥测域，实测阻断抖音导致转圈）；上一行为例外：字节系 App 后端域（mcs/日志/配置，非广告投放域）放行\ndomain(suffix: snssdk.com) -> direct\ndomain(geosite:category-ads) -> block\n\n# ⑦ 强制走代理（按域名匹配，依赖 sniffing）：OpenAI / Google / Anthropic / Microsoft 下载——必须排在 ⑧ 之前，否则 download.microsoft.com 这类国内可解析域名会先被 geoip:cn 判成直连\ndomain(geosite:openai) -> proxy\ndomain(geosite:google) -> proxy\ndomain(geosite:anthropic) -> proxy\ndomain(full:download.microsoft.com) -> proxy\n\n# ⑧ Apple 服务直连（中国区）\ndomain(full: time.apple.com, time.asia.apple.com, time.euro.apple.com) -> proxy\ndomain(suffix: apple-cloudkit.com) -> proxy\ndomain(geosite:apple-cn) -> direct\ndomain(suffix: apple.com) -> direct\ndomain(suffix: itunes.apple.com) -> direct\ndomain(suffix: icloud.com) -> direct\n\n# ⑧ 内网 + 国内直连：geoip:private（私有网段）、geoip:cn、geosite:cn\ndip(geoip:private) -> direct\ndip(geoip:cn) -> direct\ndomain(geosite:cn) -> direct\n\n# ⑧.2 国内大厂的国际业务域名直连\ndomain(suffix: tiktokglobalshop.com) -> direct\ndomain(suffix: bdurl.com) -> direct\ndomain(suffix: moto.com) -> direct\ndomain(suffix: trendyol.com) -> direct\n\n# ⑨ BT/PT 高位 UDP 直连：不走代理（不占 VPS 流量），但不断端口，避免误伤游戏语音 / WebRTC / QUIC\nl4proto(udp) && dport(1024-65535) -> direct\n\n# ⑩ 兜底：以上都未命中的流量一律走代理\nfallback: proxy\n}\n",
      "writable": true
    },
    {
      "id": "src_04ea3cefc8e6df08",
      "path": "config.d/dns.dae",
      "kind": "include",
      "content": "# 由 daed 的 wing.db 转换而来(dns 段原样保留)。\n\ndns {\nipversion_prefer: 4\n\nupstream {\n  alidns: 'udp://203.0.113.1:53'\n  cloudflare: 'udp://203.0.113.1:53'\n}\n\nrouting {\n  request {\n    qtype(naptr) -> reject\n    node(name_regex: \".*\") -> alidns\n    sub(tag_regex: \".*\") -> alidns\n    qname(suffix: snssdk.com, suffix: zijieapi.com, suffix: volces.com, suffix: isnssdk.com, suffix: pstatp.com, suffix: toutiao.com, suffix: byteimg.com, suffix: ixigua.com, suffix: fqnovel.com) -> alidns\n    qname(geosite:cn) -> alidns\n    fallback: cloudflare\n  }\n  response {\n    upstream(cloudflare) -> accept\n    !qname(geosite:cn) && ip(geoip:private) -> cloudflare\n    fallback: accept\n  }\n}\n}\n",
      "writable": true
    }
  ],
